  cell $lut21 blackbox LUT6 #(INIT=64'd9223231301513871360) (I0={%count[4:4], %count[3:3], %count[2:2], %count[1:1], %count[0:0]}[0:0], I1={%count[4:4], %count[3:3], %count[2:2], %count[1:1], %count[0:0]}[1:1], I2={%count[4:4], %count[3:3], %count[2:2], %count[1:1], %count[0:0]}[2:2], I3={%count[4:4], %count[3:3], %count[2:2], %count[1:1], %count[0:0]}[3:3], I4={%count[4:4], %count[3:3], %count[2:2], %count[1:1], %count[0:0]}[4:4], I5=1'd0) -> (O=%$lut8)
